{
  "app": {
    "name": "No-Code JSON Studio",
    "version": "trigger-def-view-v0.1"
  },
  "views": [
    {
      "id": "trigger_def_view",
      "caption": "TriggerDef 一覧",
      "layout": {
        "detailDialog": "wide"
      },
      "toolbar": {
        "executeButton": {
          "visible": true,
          "caption": "表示行をMD出力",
          "action": "ExportMarkdown"
        }
      },
      "markdown": {
        "enabled": true,
        "type": "generic_sections",
        "title": "TriggerDef Review Report",
        "defaultFileName": "trigger_def_review_report.md",
        "sections": [
          {
            "title": "概要",
            "source": "header",
            "format": "detailList",
            "fields": [
              {
                "field": "title",
                "caption": "タイトル"
              },
              {
                "field": "description",
                "caption": "説明",
                "format": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "field": "design_note",
                "caption": "設計メモ",
                "format": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "field": "summary.core_definition",
                "caption": "中核定義",
                "format": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "field": "summary.short_definition",
                "caption": "短縮定義"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "TriggerDef一覧",
            "source": "grid",
            "format": "table",
            "fields": [
              {
                "field": "trigger_id",
                "caption": "Trigger ID"
              },
              {
                "field": "trigger_name",
                "caption": "Trigger名"
              },
              {
                "field": "category",
                "caption": "区分"
              },
              {
                "field": "ai_reading_mode",
                "caption": "AI読み方"
              },
              {
                "field": "strategy_id",
                "caption": "Strategy ID"
              },
              {
                "field": "status",
                "caption": "状態"
              }
            ],
            "aiPrompt": {
              "enabled": true,
              "title": "TriggerDefレビュー用プロンプト",
              "targetFile": "trigger_def_data_v0_1.json",
              "rowSource": "filtered",
              "visibleOnly": true,
              "includeGridJson": true,
              "template": [
                "以下はTriggerDefの現在表示中の行です。",
                "各TriggerDefについて、発動条件・AI読み方・Prompt Strategy・出力項目が整合しているかレビューしてください。",
                "",
                "観点:",
                "- activation_phrases が自然なユーザー発話として妥当か",
                "- ai_reading_mode と prompt_strategy が一致しているか",
                "- output_sections が人間の判断に十分か",
                "- do_not がAIの誤動作防止として有効か",
                "",
                "TSV:"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "sections": [
        {
          "id": "header",
          "caption": "基本情報",
          "type": "form",
          "dataPath": "$",
          "fields": [
            {
              "field": "schema_version",
              "caption": "Schema Version",
              "type": "text",
              "readonly": true,
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true,
                "readonly": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "data_type",
              "caption": "Data Type",
              "type": "text",
              "readonly": true,
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true,
                "readonly": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "title",
              "caption": "タイトル",
              "type": "text",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "description",
              "caption": "説明",
              "type": "textarea",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true,
                "height": 120
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "design_note",
              "caption": "設計メモ",
              "type": "textarea",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true,
                "height": 120
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "related_concepts",
              "caption": "関連概念",
              "type": "stringArray",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "summary.core_definition",
              "caption": "中核定義",
              "type": "textarea",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true,
                "height": 120
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "summary.short_definition",
              "caption": "短縮定義",
              "type": "text",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "summary.initial_trigger_count",
              "caption": "初期Trigger数",
              "type": "number",
              "readonly": true,
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true,
                "readonly": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "triggers",
          "caption": "TriggerDef一覧",
          "type": "grid",
          "dataPath": "$.triggers",
          "keyField": "trigger_id",
          "fields": [
            {
              "field": "trigger_id",
              "caption": "Trigger ID",
              "type": "text",
              "readonly": true,
              "grid": {
                "visible": true,
                "width": 220
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true,
                "readonly": true
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              },
              "validation": {
                "required": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "trigger_name",
              "caption": "Trigger名",
              "type": "text",
              "grid": {
                "visible": true,
                "width": 190
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              },
              "validation": {
                "required": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "category",
              "caption": "区分",
              "type": "select",
              "control": "combobox",
              "options": [
                "UI違和感",
                "テスト設計",
                "作業",
                "判断",
                "制約",
                "差分",
                "文脈保守",
                "文脈引継ぎ",
                "未整理思考",
                "発信",
                "言葉",
                "記録更新",
                "違和感"
              ],
              "grid": {
                "visible": true,
                "width": 130
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "equals"
              },
              "validation": {
                "required": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "ai_reading_mode",
              "caption": "AI解釈モード",
              "type": "text",
              "grid": {
                "visible": true,
                "width": 260
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "strategy_id",
              "caption": "Strategy ID",
              "type": "text",
              "grid": {
                "visible": true,
                "width": 300
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "prompt_strategy",
              "caption": "Prompt Strategy",
              "type": "textarea",
              "grid": {
                "visible": true,
                "width": 420
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true,
                "height": 150
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "contains"
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "status",
              "caption": "状態",
              "type": "select",
              "control": "select",
              "options": [
                {
                  "cd": "draft",
                  "name": "下書き"
                },
                {
                  "cd": "active",
                  "name": "運用中"
                },
                {
                  "cd": "deprecated",
                  "name": "廃止候補"
                }
              ],
              "grid": {
                "visible": true,
                "width": 100
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              },
              "search": {
                "visible": true,
                "operator": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "activation_phrases",
              "caption": "発動フレーズ",
              "type": "stringArray",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "output_sections",
              "caption": "出力セクション",
              "type": "stringArray",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "default_artifacts",
              "caption": "標準成果物",
              "type": "stringArray",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "review_points",
              "caption": "レビュー観点",
              "type": "stringArray",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              }
            },
            {
              "field": "do_not",
              "caption": "禁止・注意",
              "type": "stringArray",
              "grid": {
                "visible": false
              },
              "edit": {
                "visible": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "markdown": {
            "aiPrompt": {
              "enabled": true,
              "title": "TriggerDef改善プロンプト",
              "targetFile": "trigger_def_data_v0_1.json",
              "rowSource": "selected",
              "visibleOnly": false,
              "includeGridJson": true,
              "template": [
                "以下のTriggerDef 1件をレビューし、改善案を出してください。",
                "",
                "観点:",
                "- trigger_name / category / activation_phrases の一貫性",
                "- ai_reading_mode と prompt_strategy の対応",
                "- output_sections / default_artifacts / review_points の過不足",
                "- do_not がAI誤動作の防止に効いているか",
                "",
                "出力:",
                "- 良い点",
                "- 変更候補",
                "- 追加すべきactivation_phrases",
                "- 削ってよい項目",
                "",
                "TSV:"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}